{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528192310,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","part":{"id":"prt_1d2371cab001Ny4Af7GJG0gScY","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","messageID":"msg_1d237078d001xVCycEjH6TFRqt","type":"text","text":"Confirmed the code behavior: `index.mjs:53` registers unless `!== false`, `guards.patch.yml:6` writes `true`, and `prompt-advisor.mjs:160` skips delivery for a lineage leaf. Now the two doc edits.","time":{"start":1794528189611,"end":1794528192310}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528192356,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2371e560016C5yxffL2db5sW","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","messageID":"msg_1d237078d001xVCycEjH6TFRqt","type":"tool","id":"call_b83a4213ca0145758475a2f1","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md","oldString":"The guards patch turns the prompt advisor on. The lineage patch keeps it off for a fan-out leaf through its marker row, so the flag stays `true` in both compositions.","newString":"The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor."},"output":"Edited .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md","patch":"Index: .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n+++ .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n@@ -109,9 +109,9 @@\n ---\n \n ## 5. CONFIGURATION\n \n-The guards patch turns the prompt advisor on. The lineage patch keeps it off for a fan-out leaf through its marker row, so the flag stays `true` in both compositions.\n+The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor.\n \n ```yaml\n - id: repo-guards\n   name: ../plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"The guards patch turns the prompt advisor on. The lineage patch keeps it off for a fan-out leaf through its marker row, so the flag stays `true` in both compositions.\",\"newString\":\"The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528190038,"end":1794528192356}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528192370,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","part":{"partID":"prt_1d237223c001h2iGQrI7ZAdVbK","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","messageID":"msg_1d237078d001xVCycEjH6TFRqt","type":"tool","id":"call_89e19847476e40a9bb08b291","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md","oldString":"| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. Off unless the `promptAdvisor` row flag is true. | Fails open. |","newString":"| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |"},"output":"Edited .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md","patch":"Index: .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n+++ .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n@@ -35,9 +35,9 @@\n | `goal-manage.mjs` | `agent/created`, `agent/pre-step`, `agent/turn-stopping`, `agent/status` | Registers `/goal-dsh` and `dsh_goal`, injects the goal brief, records the turn and delivers the verify note on idle. | Fails open. A fan-out leaf keeps the surface off. |\n | `mcp-route-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `mcp__*` | Enforces MCP routing and denies a `code_mode` tool outside `call_tool_chain`, `list_tools`, `search_tools` and `tool_info`. | Fails closed. |\n | `overlay-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Denies a path an overlay owns and allows a path it cannot judge. | Fails open. |\n | `post-edit-quality.mjs` | `tools/post-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Runs the post-edit quality router and adds its findings to the result. | Fails open. |\n-| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. Off unless the `promptAdvisor` row flag is true. | Fails open. |\n+| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |\n | `session-compact-context.mjs` | `session/event` (`compaction/end`) | Re-primes the agent after a completed compaction with the session-prime `compact` source. | Fails open. A failed compaction gets nothing. |\n | `session-role.mjs` | Shared helper, no event | Reads and writes the process-wide lineage-leaf marker on `Symbol.for('skilled.repo-guards.lineage-leaf')`. | No error path. A missing marker reads as false. |\n | `session-start-advisories.mjs` | `agent/created` (`startup`) | Runs the warn-only session-start guards from this checkout and injects one notice with their warnings. | Fails open per guard. |\n | `session-start-context.mjs` | `agent/created` | Injects `session-prime.js` output for a startup or resumed session and exports `runSessionPrime`. | Fails open. |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\",\"oldString\":\"| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. Off unless the `promptAdvisor` row flag is true. | Fails open. |\",\"newString\":\"| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528191036,"end":1794528192370}}}}
