{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528204322,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","part":{"partID":"prt_1d23751f4002hpwXtznLFLeV6s","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","messageID":"msg_1d237444a001ER3ENE5dY0GNFx","type":"tool","id":"call_e40207530eba45abb7094e24","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md; echo \"---\"; git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --short -- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"diff --git a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\nindex a4fdb022fb..fc900841ef 100644\n--- a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n+++ b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n@@ -110,7 +110,7 @@ Context adapters call `agent.inject` or return `additionalContexts`. Their core\n \n ## 5. CONFIGURATION\n \n-The guards patch turns the prompt advisor on. The lineage patch keeps it off for a fan-out leaf through its marker row, so the flag stays `true` in both compositions.\n+The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor.\n \n ```yaml\n - id: repo-guards\ndiff --git a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\nindex c677781df7..8fc90495f7 100644\n--- a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n+++ b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ version: 1.0.1.0\n | `mcp-route-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `mcp__*` | Enforces MCP routing and denies a `code_mode` tool outside `call_tool_chain`, `list_tools`, `search_tools` and `tool_info`. | Fails closed. |\n | `overlay-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Denies a path an overlay owns and allows a path it cannot judge. | Fails open. |\n | `post-edit-quality.mjs` | `tools/post-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Runs the post-edit quality router and adds its findings to the result. | Fails open. |\n-| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. Off unless the `promptAdvisor` row flag is true. | Fails open. |\n+| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |\n | `session-compact-context.mjs` | `session/event` (`compaction/end`) | Re-primes the agent after a completed compaction with the session-prime `compact` source. | Fails open. A failed compaction gets nothing. |\n | `session-role.mjs` | Shared helper, no event | Reads and writes the process-wide lineage-leaf marker on `Symbol.for('skilled.repo-guards.lineage-leaf')`. | No error path. A missing marker reads as false. |\n | `session-start-advisories.mjs` | `agent/created` (`startup`) | Runs the warn-only session-start guards from this checkout and injects one notice with their warnings. | Fails open per guard. |\n---\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/tests/bundle.test.mjs\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\nindex a4fdb022fb..fc900841ef 100644\n--- a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n+++ b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n@@ -110,7 +110,7 @@ Context adapters call `agent.inject` or return `additionalContexts`. Their core\n \n ## 5. CONFIGURATION\n \n-The guards patch turns the prompt advisor on. The lineage patch keeps it off for a fan-out leaf through its marker row, so the flag stays `true` in both compositions.\n+The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor.\n \n ```yaml\n - id: repo-guards\ndiff --git a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\nindex c677781df7..8fc90495f7 100644\n--- a/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n+++ b/.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ version: 1.0.1.0\n | `mcp-route-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `mcp__*` | Enforces MCP routing and denies a `code_mode` tool outside `call_tool_chain`, `list_tools`, `search_tools` and `tool_info`. | Fails closed. |\n | `overlay-guard.mjs` | `tools/pre-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Denies a path an overlay owns and allows a path it cannot judge. | Fails open. |\n | `post-edit-quality.mjs` | `tools/post-execute` on `write`, `edit` and `apply_patch` | Runs the post-edit quality router and adds its findings to the result. | Fails open. |\n-| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. Off unless the `promptAdvisor` row flag is true. | Fails open. |\n+| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |\n | `session-compact-context.mjs` | `session/event` (`compaction/end`) | Re-primes the agent after a completed compaction with the session-prime `compact` source. | Fails open. A failed compaction gets nothing. |\n | `session-role.mjs` | Shared helper, no event | Reads and writes the process-wide lineage-leaf marker on `Symbol.for('skilled.repo-guards.lineage-leaf')`. | No error path. A missing marker reads as false. |\n | `session-start-advisories.mjs` | `agent/created` (`startup`) | Runs the warn-only session-start guards from this checkout and injects one notice with their warnings. | Fails open per guard. |\n---\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/tests/bundle.test.mjs\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md; echo \\\"---\\\"; git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --short -- .dsh/plugins/repo-guards\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528203252,"end":1794528204322}}}}
