{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528211559,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","part":{"id":"prt_1d2376407002vE35DE0XMeWca8","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb12d3ffevysEI5uvl2ewzH","messageID":"msg_1d2375b5b001Ll6usP01uXhgYq","type":"text","text":"T013 done. Both README statements now match the code, and the verify pair passes.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md` — section 5 says the bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief.\n- `.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md` — the `prompt-advisor.mjs` row carries the same three facts and no longer says \"Off unless\".\n\n**Verify output**\n\n```\n$ rg -n \"unless its row flag .false.\" .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md:113:The bundle registers the prompt advisor unless its row flag `false` is set. The guards patch still writes `true`, which leaves the advisor on in both compositions. The lineage patch does not change the flag. It mounts its marker row, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief because the adapter returns before it asks the advisor.\n.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md:39:| `prompt-advisor.mjs` | `agent/created`, `session/event`, `agent/pre-step` | Runs the Skill Advisor and adds the brief to the step. The bundle registers it unless its row flag `false` is set, the guards patch still writes `true`, and a lineage leaf stays without a brief. | Fails open. |\nexit=0\n```\n\n```\n$ rg -n \"Off unless\" .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/README.md\nexit=1\n```\n\nTwo lines printed for the first check. The second printed nothing and exited 1, which is ripgrep's no-match status.\n\n**Grounding for the wording**\n- `index.mjs:53` registers with `enabled: options.promptAdvisor !== false`.\n- `.dsh/patches/guards.patch.yml:6` still writes `promptAdvisor: true`.\n- `adapters/prompt-advisor.mjs:160` returns before calling the advisor when the lineage marker is set.\n\n**Not done**\n- Did not tick the T013 checkbox in `tasks.md`, as instructed.\n- `git status` also lists `.dsh/plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs` and `tests/bundle.test.mjs` as modified. Those are another worker's T006 changes, not mine. My diff is limited to the two READMEs above.","time":{"start":1794528207879,"end":1794528211559}}}
